// One frame: report status (world/world.id), rebuild + draw the scene at
// tick t, then poll one input event. glwin_poll returns -2 when the window (or
// GFX_MAX_FRAMES) wants to close, -1 for no event, or a key code; idstd's
// inp_live turns that into a keep-running flag (Esc or q also quit) -- same
// convention as demos/gl3d/loop/frame.id.

frame(int tick) {
  world_update(tick);
  world_render(tick);
  int input_event = glwin_poll();
} return int input_event;
given world_initialize (0):(-1)
given world_initialize (60):(-1)
